</surname><given-names>DP</given-names></name><name><surname>Horiuchi</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Dzau</surname><given-names>VJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cloning and characterization of ATRAP, a novel protein that interacts with the angiotensin II type 1 receptor</article-title><source>J. Biol. Chem.</source><year>1999</year><volume>274</volume><fpage>17058</fpage><lpage>17062</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10358057</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B5"><label>5</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Elton</surname><given-names>TS</given-names></name><name><surname>Martin</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Angiotensin II type 1 receptor gene regulation: transcriptional and posttranscriptional mechanisms</article-title><source>Hypertension</source><year>2007</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>953</fpage><lpage>961</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17325239</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B6"><label>6</label><element-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Nickenig</surname><given-names>G</given-names></name><name><surname>Michaelsen</surname><given-names>F</given-names></name><name><surname>Muller</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Berger</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vogel</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Sachinidis</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vetter</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Bohm</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Destabilization of AT(1) receptor mRNA by calreticulin</article-title><source>Circ. Res.</source><year>2002</year><volume>90</volume><fpage>53</fpage><lpage>58</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">11786518</pub-id></element-citation></ref><ref id="B7